  "summary": "Possible typosquat of @solana/web3.js with postinstall script",
  "details": "Package name @solana-labs/web3js closely resembles the legitimate Solana SDK package @solana/web3.js (different scope and missing dot in module name). The package.json declares a postinstall hook that executes a local install.js script on every install. The contents of install.js were not contextually traced, so the actual install-time behavior is unverified. The combination of a confusable scope/name against a widely-used cryptocurrency SDK and an auto-executing postinstall script warrants human review before this package is allowed in a build pipeline.",
